<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sepracor started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sepracor started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Vector Securities analyst Barbara Dau Hoffman said she started coverage of Sepracor Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>--Shares in the drug development concern were unchanged at 16.</p>
<p>--&quot;We view investment in Sepracor Inc as offering the high potential returns of a biopharma company developing proprietary drugs combined with the lower risk enjoyed by drug delivery companies,&quot; she said.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
